  annotation = {中文辅助译名：紫荆花研究进展},
  abstract = {Objective To review the studies on Bauhiniae.Methods The chemical constituents and pharmacological activities were summarized respectively.Results The prime types of chemical constituents in Bauhinia are flavonoids,phenolic acids,stilbenes and steroids.Little stibenes and alkloids were also found.The extract of Bauhinia has the antirheumatic,hypoglycaemic and astringent activities.Conclusions This review provides a reference to further study on Bauhinia.},
